# Based on the MLOps HS26 Block 1 exercise, Part C, F. Bär [5] in README.md.
# Keep the build context small and free of data and secrets: only pyproject.toml,
# uv.lock and src/ are needed to build the image.
# secrets and local settings (never into an image)
.env
.env.*
.dvc
# data and models (the data is mounted at run time)
data
*.csv
*.parquet
mlruns
models
# Python and tools
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
# not needed in the image
.git
.github
tests
docs
notebooks
README.md
